## System Architecture

```text
                +------------------+
                |     Client       |
                | Postman / Frontend|
                +---------+--------+
                          |
                          |
                     HTTP Request
                          |
                          v
                +------------------+
                |  Express Routes  |
                +---------+--------+
                          |
                          |
                +---------v--------+
                |   Controllers    |
                +---------+--------+
                          |
                          |
                +---------v--------+
                |     Services     |
                | Business Logic   |
                +---------+--------+
                          |
            +-------------+-------------+
            |                           |
            |                           |
+-----------v---------+      +----------v---------+
|   Repositories      |      |  Adjutor Service   |
|  Knex Query Builder |      | External API       |
+-----------+---------+      +--------------------+
            |
            |
+-----------v----------+
|       MySQL          |
| users                |
| wallets              |
| transactions         |
+----------------------+
```